# GitHub Personal Access Token (PAT)
# Optional: Set this to access private repositories and increase API rate limits
# 
# To create a token:
# 1. Go to https://github.com/settings/tokens
# 2. Click "Generate new token" -> "Generate new token (classic)"
# 3. Give it a name and select scopes:
#    - For private repos: repo (Full control of private repositories)
#    - For public repos only: public_repo (Access public repositories)
# 4. Copy the token and set it here
#
# GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_your_token_here

